      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The darkness in the hall matches the emptiness within you, a fitting end to a life spent carrying burdens that can no longer be shouldered. There is no shame in receiving the rest of your story, for honor was never the destiny of a broken warrior but a fleeting flame that now needs to be allowed to fade. Let this quiet vigil at the ash become your own form of peace, one that finally lets you breathe without the weight of the crown pressing against your chest.",
