    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "The weight... it's so heavy. I look at my sword, the steel still cold and sharp, and I wonder if that's the only thing in this world that's still honest with me. Everything else was just an illusion. Even the peace you speak of... it feels so far away. How can a man find peace when there's nothing left but this ruin?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
