      "content": "It is not your duty to force peace upon a world that has already claimed you, but rather to honor the sword by sheathing it as a sign of surrender. The honesty in the steel is not in what it can do, but in what it signifies: that your time as a weapon is over, and that is the only peace this ruin truly respects. Find quiet in the silence instead of chasing a future that no longer exists, for sometimes the greatest act of bravery is simply standing still.",
